/**
 * Marketing landing page.
 *
 * Built from the approved design: warm Mediterranean light theme,
 * serif display headline, floating product cards over the hero
 * photograph, three-audience feature row, POS integration bar.
 *
 * The hero photograph is layered via CSS: drop landing-hero.jpg into
